  "question": {
    "text": "A disc is performing pure rolling on a smooth stationary surface with constant angular velocity as shown in figure. At any instant, for the lower most point of the disc $-$\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/bfu6gxTxLm9omThWIOLYfn6k6jrae-NkE4zEXENd360.original.fullsize.png\">",
    "image": null
